~ start
Viktor: The tree blocks more wind than I expected. I can breathe for a minute.
Viktor: Someone camped here before me... a bag, photographs, scraps half-buried in the snow.
Viktor: Whoever they were, they did not leave in a hurry.
Viktor: If they knew this valley, there may be something here that can get me to the railway.
Viktor: I should search the camp before I move on.
=> END